e big fish for him, I bet it'll make him happy.","nextNodeIds":[220040105]},{"nodeId":220040105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":220101,"speakerName":"Jiangxue","textMapHash":3013002333,"text":"The only thing is, monsters keep stirring up trouble here, which disturbs the fish.","nextNodeIds":[220040106]},{"nodeId":220040106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":220101,"speakerName":"Jiangxue","textMapHash":3357068885,"text":"I sense strong elemental power in you. Would you be willing to deal with the monsters for me, so I can finally catch that fish?","nextNodeIds":[220040107,220040109]},{"nodeId":220040107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":337388077,"text":"Okay.","nextNodeIds":[220040108]},{"nodeId":220040108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":220101,"speakerName":"Jiangxue","textMapHash":1165997869,"text":"Thank you.","nextNodeIds":[220040112]},{"nodeId":220040112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2327540085,"text":"But how do you know when the monsters will get here?","nextNodeIds":[220040113]},{"nodeId":220040113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":220101,"speakerName":"Jiangxue","textMapHash":2925014773,"text":"Seeing is believing. Look out behind you.","nextNodeIds":[220040114]},{"nodeId":220040114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1610902325,"text":"Hah! That's the oldest trick in the book—","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":220040109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2165391205,"text":"How can you tell?","nextNodeIds":[220040110]},{"nodeId":220040110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":220101,"speakerName":"Jiangxue","textMapHash":136637349,"text":"I once had a Vision, too. I don't bother using it anymore, but I can still sense elemental power when I want to.","nextNodeIds":[220040111]},{"nodeId":220040111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":220101,"speakerName":"Jiangxue","textMapHash":3402924757,"text":"With the power of the elements on your side, these monsters should be a piece of cake for you.","nextNodeIds":[220040112]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2200401,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133104901,2"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_START","LNHLPKELCAL":["220101"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":2200402,"order":2,"stepDescription":"Defeat opponents","stepDescTextMapHash":2451682106,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"1331049011"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["Q22004Target","30"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[],"talks":[],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"1331049011"}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133104901,3"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCI